@Node Intro "(-     Features      -)"

    I thought that there was no well Designed Comment Door.
    So I decided to code a cooler one. Here it is ! 

    If U just use the comment C then the Menu will appear but
    if u use C 1 or C 2 or C x then the Sysop Number 1,2,x will
    automatically get a mail.
  

                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}
@endnode
@Node Install "(-   Installation    -)"

 
  /X2.x: Append the following Line to your
         BBS:Commands/BBS.CMD File:
         ---------------------->> Cut Here <<--------------------------
         c          RM020DOORS:cOMMENT/cOMMENT.rexx
         ---------------------->> Cut Here <<--------------------------

  /X3.x: 1) Copy C.INFO to your BBS:Syscmd-Drawer
         2) Copy Comment-Drawer to your Doors:
	  
    *** Complete ***

 
                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}
@endnode
@Node Instr "(- Instruction -)"


         cOMMENT.cFG:


         ---------------------->> Cut Here <<--------------------------
         [-jOE cOOl!]
         I am the Hardware Sysop
         [-gONZALEZ!]
         I am the Software Sysop
         ---------------------->> Cut Here <<--------------------------

         First you have to insert The name of a Sysop
         Then you have to insert the comment line. Thats all!



                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}
@endnode

